      "name": "Unified low-poly project style",
      "art_direction": "All characters, creatures, equipment, projectiles, buildings, terrain pieces, and decorations must use one coherent low-poly visual language. Each asset should read as a lightweight production mesh, not concept art, not a high-poly render, and not a glossy toy. Do not imitate a recognizable game, franchise, or studio style.",
